abstract: "DDoS-AI is an enterprise-grade, high-throughput network security and artificial intelligence platform designed to detect, classify, and mitigate volumetric, reflection, application-layer, and zero-day Distributed Denial of Service (DDoS) attacks. Featuring an ultra-fast O(1) histogram-binned tree screening tier (sub-millisecond line-rate inspection) cascading to deep residual tabular neural networks for ambiguous high-entropy flows, the architecture achieves a 14.9x latency speedup over recurrent attention baselines while maintaining 96.09% F1-score across heterogeneous multi-domain network environments."
